# Roadmap § 9.2 — Server handling & persistence.
#
# None of these are set in this repo. D-10 (Supabase plan and region for
# Artaveo) is still open — no Artaveo Supabase project exists yet (only
# the unrelated pajouhesh-portal and Transportation-System projects are
# provisioned under the same account). Until these are set,
# app/actions/inquiries.ts honestly returns "not configured" instead of
# crashing or faking success — see lib/supabase/server.ts.
#
# Once D-10 is resolved and a project exists, copy this file to .env.local
# (already gitignored) and fill in the real values from the Supabase
# project's API settings. NEVER commit real values — the service-role key
# bypasses Row Level Security entirely.

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Used only to salt the IP hash stored for rate-limiting (§ 9.2: "without
# extra personal data" — the raw IP itself is never stored). Any random
# string; rotate it and old hashes simply stop matching, which is fine.
INQUIRY_IP_HASH_SECRET=
